410
00:36:25,680 --> 00:36:29,480
ずっと追いかけて行こう
Let's keep chasing after them forever!

411
00:36:29,680 --> 00:36:32,180
風を裂いて
Tearing through the wind,

412
00:36:32,180 --> 00:36:34,680
雨を抜けて
breaking through the rain,

413
00:36:34,680 --> 00:36:39,480
咲き誇れ 満天の空へ
